WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:09.809
In 1900, all the world's mathematical knowledge
could be written in about 80 books; today

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:21.030
it would fill more than 100,000.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:27.160
James Garfield, 20th president of the USA,
could write Greek with one hand while writing

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.750
Latin with the other.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:35.859
Human saliva contains a painkiller called
opiorphin that is six times more powerful

00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:37.640
than morphine.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:43.269
The platypus and the echidna are the only
mammals that could make their own custard:

00:00:43.269 --> 00:00:46.570
they both lay eggs and produce milk.

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:53.859
The Archbishop of Manila from 1974–2003
was called Cardinal Sin.

00:00:53.859 --> 00:01:00.769
There is a single mega-colony of ants that
spans three continents, covering much of Europe,

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:05.540
the west coast of the U.S., and the west coast
of Japan.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:11.210
A 'riot' in England and Wales must legally
involve a minimum of 12 people.

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:17.780
Under US federal law it's only three people
and in Nevada only two.

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.920
Although slavery was abolished in the British
colonies in the 19th century.

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:30.100
Slavery was not made a statutory offence in
the UK until 6th April 2010.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:34.280
An orange is a berry but a strawberry isn't.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:40.670
A 'knot' is something tied in a single piece
of rope or line.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:46.229
Something that joins two ropes together is
actually called a 'bend'.

00:01:46.229 --> 00:01:52.470
Jimmy Carter once sent a jacket to the dry-cleaner's
with the nuclear detonation codes still in

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:54.080
the pocket.

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:59.799
There is a glacier called “Blood Falls”
in Antarctica that regularly pours out red

00:01:59.799 --> 00:02:04.460
liquid, making it look like the ice is bleeding.

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:09.250
Humans have the same number of hair follicles
as chimpanzees.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:15.500
In 1715, a group of Jacobite rebels failed
to take Edinburgh Castle because their rope

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.860
ladders were six feet too short.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:24.790
All polar bears are Irish: they're descended
from brown bears that lived in Ireland over

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.610
10,000 years ago.

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:34.820
In 2007, an American man named Corey Taylor
tried to fake his own death in order to get

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:40.580
out of his cell phone contract without paying
a fee.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:44.110
But it didn't work.

